{"step_index":496,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:53:22Z","input_tokens":8645,"cache_read_tokens":211537,"output_tokens":3081,"thinking":"Building four top metric cards requires defining the content for each. The first card displays \"BALANCE\", the current dollar amount (with dynamic formatting for large values), and the starting balance. The second card presents \"TOTAL P&L\" with a neon green positive value and two badges representing percentage gain and multiplier. The third card will display information including a circle avatar with initials.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React from 'react';\nimport { ArrowUpRight, Flame, UserCheck } from 'lucide-react';\nimport { Trader } from '../types';\n\ninterface BalanceCardsProps {\n  balance: number;\n  startingBalance: number;\n  totalPnl: number;\n  pnlPercent: number;\n  pnlMultiplier: number;\n  activeTrader: Trader;\n  lossesInARow: number;\n  firedCount: number;\n  onManualFire: () => void;\n}\n\nexport const BalanceCards: React.FC<BalanceCardsProps> = ({\n  balance,\n  startingBalance,\n  totalPnl,\n  pnlPercent,\n  pnlMultiplier,\n  activeTrader,\n  lossesInARow,\n  firedCount,\n  onManualFire\n}) => {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n      {/* 1. BALANCE CARD */}\n      <div className=\"cyber-card p-4 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase\">\n          Balance\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"my-2\">\n          <div className=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono-numbers tracking-tight\">\n            ${balance.toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 })}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono-numbers mt-1\">\n            started at ${startingBalance.toFixed(2)}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"h-1 w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n          <div\n            className=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-emerald-400 transition-all duration-300\"\n            style={{ width: `${Math.min(100, (balance / 5739) * 100)}%` }}\n          ></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 2. TOTAL P&L CARD */}\n      <div className=\"cyber-card p-4 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase\">\n          <span>Total P&L</span>\n          <ArrowUpRight className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\" />\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"my-2\">\n          <div className=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 font-mono-numbers tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1 drop-shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(34,197,94,0.35)]\">\n            +${totalPnl.toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 })}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1\">\n            <span className=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-mono-numbers border border-emerald-500/20\">\n              +{pnlPercent.toLocaleString()}%\n            </span>\n            <span className=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-400 font-mono-numbers\">\n              x{pnlMultiplier.toFixed(1)}\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono-numbers flex justify-between\">\n          <span>Net Profit</span>\n          <span className=\"text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">100% Compounding</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 3. NOW COPYING CARD */}\n      <div className=\"cyber-card p-4 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <UserCheck className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400\" />\n            Now Copying\n          </div>\n          <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase\">\n            Last 6\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"my-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n          {/* Avatar and handle */}\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n            <div className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br ${activeTrader.avatarColor} flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-xs shadow-md border border-white/10 shrink-0 font-display`}>\n              {activeTrader.initials}\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white font-mono-numbers leading-tight\">\n                {activeTrader.handle}\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono-numbers mt-0.5\">\n                {activeTrader.weeklyRank} · +{activeTrader.sevenDayReturn}% 7d · copy {activeTrader.copyRatio}x\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Last 6 Win/Loss Pills */}\n          <div className=\"flex flex-col items-end\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              {activeTrader.lastSix.map((res, i) => (\n                <span\n                  key={i}\n                  className={`w-2.5 h-4 rounded-sm transition-all ${\n                    res === 'W'\n                      ? 'bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.6)]'\n                      : 'bg-rose-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(244,63,94,0.6)]'\n                  }`}\n                  title={res === 'W' ? 'Win' : 'Loss'}\n                ></span>\n              ))}\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-mono-numbers mt-1.5 font-semibold\">\n              with him: +${activeTrader.pnlWithUs.toFixed(2)}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono-numbers flex justify-between\">\n          <span>Active Allocation</span>\n          <span className=\"text-blue-400 font-semibold\">25% per Trade</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 4. FIRE RULE CARD */}\n      <div className=\"cyber-card p-4 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between border-rose-500/20\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <Flame className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-400\" />\n            Fire Rule\n          </div>\n          <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase\">\n            Losses in a row\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"my-2 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <div className=\"text-xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono-numbers tracking-tight\">\n              2 L in a row\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono-numbers mt-0.5\">\n              → next trader from weekly top\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Losses boxes */}\n          <div className=\"flex flex-col items-end\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n              <span\n                className={`w-6 h-6 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-mono-numbers text-xs font-bold border ${\n                  lossesInARow >= 1\n                    ? 'bg-rose-500/20 border-rose-500 text-rose-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(244,63,94,0.4)]'\n                    : 'bg-slate-900 border-slate-700 text-slate-500'\n                }`}\n              >\n                {lossesInARow >= 1 ? 'L' : '-'}\n              </span>\n              <span\n                className={`w-6 h-6 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-mono-numbers text-xs font-bold border ${\n                  lossesInARow >= 2\n                    ? 'bg-rose-500/20 border-rose-500 text-rose-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(244,63,94,0.4)]'\n                    : 'bg-slate-900 border-slate-700 text-slate-500'\n                }`}\n              >\n                {lossesInARow >= 2 ? 'L' : '-'}\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"text-xs font-mono-numbers text-slate-400 ml-1\">\n                {lossesInARow}/2\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono-numbers mt-1.5\">\n              fired so far: <span className=\"text-rose-400 font-bold\">{firedCount}</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-1\">\n          <span className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono-numbers\">Automated Protection</span>\n          <button\n            onClick={onManualFire}\n            className=\"text-[10px] font-mono-numbers text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 bg-rose-500/10 hover:bg-rose-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-500/20 transition-all font-semibold\"\n          >\n            Manual Fire\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n","Description":"Writing BalanceCards.tsx with the 4 key stat cards matching Grok Bot video 1","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/components/BalanceCards.tsx","toolAction":"Writing BalanceCards.tsx","toolSummary":"Create BalanceCards component"}}]}
